e o bairro Portão, a localização permite conciliar a tranquilidade de um condomínio com áreas verdes e a conveniência de estar próximo a serviços, comércio, escolas e vias importantes de Curitiba. O Portão é o bairro mais central de Curitiba!\n\n\nÁreas comuns:\n\n- Piscinas aquecidas (Interna com raia e externa)\n- Academia completa\n- Salão de festas para todos os públicos\n- Salão de jogos\n- Cinema\n- Brinquedoteca e espaço kids\n- Playground\n- Espaço pet\n- Quadra de squash\n- Quadra poliesportiva\n- Churrasqueira coletiva\n- Bosque com mais de 7.500 m² de área preservada","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ada4a5cc5407be9e6011d0b/pilar-homes-images-watermark/a7af9ff0-182a-464c-9ce2-8dd64c9bdb83.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ada4a5cc5407be9e6011d0b/pilar-homes-images-watermark/b6ff7c4e-2e46-4b16-953b-be41212668c4.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ada4a5cc5407be9e6011d0b/pilar-homes-images-watermark/cabbd916-fd2f-4e85-9a59-0f02164f748d.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ada4a5cc5407be9e6011d0b/pilar-homes-images-watermark/56096e14-9c84-44cd-8ca3-78cbcecee768.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ada4a5cc5407be9e6011d0b/pilar-homes-images-watermark/2ce0cf45-2a2f-4904-b452-c38c84246ee4.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ada4a5cc5407be9e6011d0b/pilar-homes-images-watermark/14ce24a7-4e7a-4486-a8ca-ee1eeb95b758.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ada4a5cc5407be9e6011d0b/pilar-homes-images-watermark/ecf4236d-7df3-4a2b-969a-19673d5e65a1.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ada4a5cc5407be9e6011d0b/pilar-homes-images-watermark/b4c391fe-bad9-406a-860e-aada4872322c.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ada4a5cc5407be9e6011d0b/pilar-homes-images-watermark/2155e85f-15a5-4d2e-9b4d-0c87a719adaf.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ada4a5cc540